<title>SPAIN: Tabacalera gp H1 net 7.133 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Tabacalera gp H1 net 7.133 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish tobacco group Tabacalera group first half in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit/loss			9.853  vs   9.006</p>
<p> Net taxed				   7.133  vs   6.436</p>
<p>Operating costs			164.429   vs 173.067</p>
<p>Operating result			 6.383   vs 5.080</p>
<p>Tobacco and related sales (net of VAT)</p>
<p>					   293.995   vs 256.969</p>
<p>Tobacco taxes			  169.468   vs 147.623</p>
<p>Net sales				155.127   vs 163.016</p>
<p>Ordinary earnings			9.573   vs   7.736</p>
<p>PARENT COMPANY Tobacco sales (net of VAT)</p>
<p>					   285.005   vs 249.656</p>
<p>Tobacco taxes			  169.468   vs 147.623</p>
<p>Total sales			    163.500   vs 152.025</p>
<p>Operating result			 6.463   vs   5.029</p>
<p>Ordinary earnings			9.885   vs   7.404</p>
<p>Extraordinary earnings		   72    vs   1.365</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Tabacalera Group.</p>
</text>
